@startuml
title State Diagram: Vehicle Exit (Exit Gate Controller)

top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 14
}
skinparam ArrowColor Black

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> DetectVehicle : Vehicle arrives at exit lane

DetectVehicle --> CapturePlate : Sensor triggered / ANPR capture
CapturePlate --> RetrieveSession : Plate number extracted

RetrieveSession --> DenyExit : No active session found
RetrieveSession --> CalculateFee : Active session found

CalculateFee --> CheckPayment : Fee calculated

CheckPayment --> RequestPayment : Payment pending / insufficient
CheckPayment --> OpenGate : Payment completed or not required

RequestPayment --> CheckPayment : Payment completed
RequestPayment --> DenyExit : Payment failed / timeout

OpenGate --> RecordExit : Gate opened successfully
RecordExit --> ReleaseSpot : Store exit time + release parking spot
ReleaseSpot --> ArchiveSession : Update DB and archive session
ArchiveSession --> [*]

DenyExit --> AlertSecurity : Log denial + notify security
AlertSecurity --> [*]

@enduml
